{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5da450686e6be9f88d7d9b41ceb88fbecb6cf9661a2c3482587e2997ec9a11fc", "ja": "美奈子の場合：たーんと召し上がれ♪", "zh": "美奈子的情况：请多吃点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "229bb3e09afb12bd5d02614603ef4005a29ccc9e2ab935dc07c0c09cadd75188", "ja": "美奈子は佐竹飯店で働く姿を最高の一枚の\n題材に選ぶが、撮影前に大勢の団体客が訪れ\n一緒に来ていたメンバー達も店を手伝うこと\nに。なんとか乗り切ったお礼に皆に料理を\nふるまう美奈子の笑顔を亜利沙が撮影する。", "zh": "美奈子选定了自己在佐竹饭店工作的身影作为最棒的一张照片的主题，可拍摄前却来了大批团体客人，和她一起来的成员们也只好帮忙招待。总算熬过这一关后，美奈子为大家做了料理以表谢意，亚利沙拍下了她脸上的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0fa3cd9f17e4d063446cc2bba481431a96db980a9c18dbfbb23216b6d3a509f2", "ja": "（次は美奈子が最高の一枚を撮ることに。\n場所として指定されたのは……）", "zh": "（接下来轮到美奈子拍摄最棒的一张照片了。\n指定的地点是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "e8d90105eb5bc9ddc090d2a2fff79979e26a505b22a57a9fadc1e04abeef5496", "ja": "{$P$}さん、亜利沙ちゃん、\nエミリーちゃん。ようこそ佐竹飯店へ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、亚利沙、艾米莉。欢迎来到佐竹饭店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "fb5e73fb7843c388196fe172f4e6af84e5a377a0d4bf444e96cda61184ac0784", "ja": "お邪魔いたします。美奈子さんの最高の一枚、\n撮影の瞬間を拝見させていただきますね。", "zh": "打扰了。接下来就请让我见证美奈子小姐拍出最棒照片的瞬间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f594a957900bca56794168db09f67fe64152b83d9655f3036c05fb4a22a27e9", "ja": "お手伝いできることがありましたら、何でもありさに\n言ってくださいね。いつでも！　遠慮なく！", "zh": "如果有我能帮上忙的地方，请尽管告诉亚利沙哦。随时都可以！千万别客气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5affe32095b683e03591fda3e430e40aa46b1d3ef34d82303e1a3d5a3df4c595", "ja": "ここで撮るってことは、\n美奈子は佐竹飯店で働く一枚を狙うんだな。", "zh": "既然要在这里拍摄，看来美奈子是想拍一张在佐竹饭店工作的照片啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "26d903c6e421fb249519bb3e4012d45e84b91f5ce1c4c454d205fed9a2683018", "ja": "はい。お腹いっぱいの愛を届けるのが、\n私の原点でテーマですから！", "zh": "是的。将吃得饱饱的爱传递给大家，\n就是我的初心和主题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "55a1b0d4043bfc4bd5cda8b9501e196df5923ae69e6c1b0abc262cef3709b9ae", "ja": "ただ、特定のこの瞬間っていうイメージはなくて……\nいろいろ撮ってもらいつつ決めようかなって。", "zh": "不过，并没有特别锁定某个瞬间的具体印象……我是想先多拍一些，再决定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0c0ce2c418b275156c047b98b844b6c24fda9540f8b4c7e97d31ca605a48db84", "ja": "それもいいんじゃないかな。\n進める中で見えてくるものもあるだろうし。", "zh": "那样也不错吧。边进行边应该也会有新的发现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1008_se", "source_sha256": "2d43cfcca53552459bea035074b81db5e70363814af11cc49c428a2f92d1f39e", "ja": "ガラガラッ", "zh": "哗啦啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1009_sararimannodanntai", "source_sha256": "404d4273896852b8c2421f051f1164984577f7ee86e965b44729eace508d9be1", "ja": "今日は町中華にするか。\nすみませーん、ランチもうやってます？", "zh": "今天就吃家常中餐吧。\n不好意思——已经开始供应午餐了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e3094ed2b45864ef0ce0703bdca4c507ab5fd28281ec29a74731af63f8e5f38f", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ、大丈夫ですよー！\nご案内しますね♪", "zh": "欢迎光临，当然可以哦——！我带您过去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bae1ec1443b34bb70e28d4af10f38d5ffee933e53c716baab517315f763bfc24", "ja": "おっと、そろそろランチタイムか。\nいきなり団体さんとは、忙しくなりそう……ん？", "zh": "哎呀，差不多到午餐时间了啊。\n突然来了这么一大群客人，看来要忙起来了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1012_se", "source_sha256": "2d43cfcca53552459bea035074b81db5e70363814af11cc49c428a2f92d1f39e", "ja": "ガラガラッ", "zh": "哗啦啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1013_kennsetugennbasyokunin", "source_sha256": "c5888f77687e8b22a12f27eec119c3ca04645231c99ab420e0337327b4abfa8f", "ja": "お嬢ちゃーん！\n10人なんだけど、入れる～？", "zh": "小姑娘——！\n我们一共有10人，可以进去吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "685a708accee57794b894b6c872bb3c876e83078b67b94832d2c2061ca32a84b", "ja": "はーい！\nただいまー！", "zh": "来啦！\n现在就来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "3179879d3f161ae0f3dfcba848f5fb5a2a4d3d809babb37efd89b7c2969d7992", "ja": "ま、また団体さんですね。\nおじさん達が大勢……。", "zh": "呜，又是团体客啊。\n大叔们来了好多人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "7ad63f93a3b67c85e1a98a4b77af4218b2caadeb74db40d3c24391f5b7437aae", "ja": "もしかして、来る途中で見かけた、\n大きな建設現場の方達でしょうか……。", "zh": "难道是我们来的路上看到的那个大型施工现场的工人们……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b783871cc7ed1f0f18e9562af51aee7582e3478f70b0ba4d64e16ceb63d1d00b", "ja": "あったな……。\nだとすると、人数はこんなもんじゃなくて……。", "zh": "确实有来着……  \n这样的话，人数应该不止这些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1018_se", "source_sha256": "2d43cfcca53552459bea035074b81db5e70363814af11cc49c428a2f92d1f39e", "ja": "ガラガラッ", "zh": "哗啦啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1019_sudoukoujinosagyouin", "source_sha256": "648f1075502c731f4967c64b30e69a182ae1385ae9ee6cf2e8f7fa19cf974499", "ja": "うおっ、もういっぱいかぁ。\nあのー、まだ入れるかなー？　8人！", "zh": "哇，已经满员了啊。\n那个……还能再进来8个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff8095e9597dafebd2771d52563e547babd1020e49faf8cc997995589e2a0955", "ja": "焼豚中華そば、海老の卵黄酢油和え、焼き飯\n大盛りですね……！　少々お待ちください！", "zh": "叉烧中式拉面、虾仁蛋黄醋油拌菜、炒饭\n您要加大份对吧……！请稍等片刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "93a62093e90e9a6338e30854045a045d6b35ac592b2de11fae192c6457045f97", "ja": "餃子とネギラーメン、回鍋肉お待たせしましたぁ！\n……え、天津飯が来てない……？", "zh": "饺子和葱拉面、回锅肉来了！\n……诶，天津饭还没上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "f93052ad4330233ed88ad03b05922edd1f3c32880655503da577ffaee44d6c3f", "ja": "お父さーん！\n天津飯通ってるよねー！？", "zh": "爸爸——！\n天津饭已经下单了吧——？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1026_minakotiti", "source_sha256": "0ba09c7f51d5cd983b833857f7e1ef78a42a1e5e9309d7ee201f52b2af74ba70", "ja": "今あがるよ！\n{$P$}さん、皿、出ますかね？", "zh": "马上就端上来哦！\n{$P$}先生，要把盘子拿出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7a1e190ee5de2e3f8c8ed84f687aa988106a9ed688a6a7087bf71495c41c27f7", "ja": "は、はい！\n今洗い終わりました……！　これを！", "zh": "是、是的！\n刚洗完……给！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "362dc503a791af1ce2aaf59c3275042156666345fad95412d831706c7e8dea3c", "ja": "す、すみません、\nみんなにうちの手伝いをさせちゃって……！", "zh": "对、对不起，居然让大家帮我干家里的活……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "03ede46d98a6922e4f01bee0261ef8dd577522c31bea32d38dc20dacebb8e670", "ja": "いや、さすがに見過ごせないから。\nそんなことより、天津飯もっていってくれ！", "zh": "没事，毕竟也不能坐视不管嘛。\n比起这个，快把天津饭端过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "eea3e4a233e20a13bd75a275b4bf5f9192a04a048e0490926423f43479cda1d2", "ja": "（突然戦場となった佐竹飯店。なんとかピークを\n乗り越えて、ようやく一息つくことができた……）", "zh": "（佐竹饭店突然变成了战场。总算熬过了高峰期，终于能喘口气了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1031_minakotiti", "source_sha256": "83cac683a854e3aa85f95b8ab61aeb713d82c9ca742d9bace980fb88a12cb22a", "ja": "いやぁ、助かりました！\n皿洗いまでさせちゃって、申し訳ない！", "zh": "哎呀，真是帮了大忙了！\n还让你帮忙洗了盘子，真是不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ca31937c5af7e6ba2959418c3383a0c3f098f9543cd6f6b1e28d2a9a6106d0da", "ja": "いえいえ、気になさらないでください。\n困った時はお互いさまですから。", "zh": "哪里哪里，请别放在心上。\n遇到困难时本就应该互相照应嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "bd0099f962113d8a413a0d2921978bc2ed53d9eefaa86d046114a75f236f678a", "ja": "むしろ、見よう見まねの給仕で、\nかえってご迷惑ではありませんでしたか？", "zh": "倒是我这样现学现卖地帮忙招待，反而给您添麻烦了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1034_minakotiti", "source_sha256": "b7095b8820881de4076dd0077815923acaf37ba5ffc1c3393571a709db0eb0e9", "ja": "とんでもない！　今日のラッシュは特別すごかったし、\n本当に助かりました。ありがとうね、二人とも！", "zh": "哪里的话！今天的忙碌高峰特别厉害，真的帮大忙了。\n谢谢你们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "d4ec6573a3ce160975f093f2de47a537274d662c8a9f9c8ec3b1d77bf47834bf", "ja": "お力になれたのでしたら何よりです！\n……それにしても、気のせいでしょうか。", "zh": "如果能帮上忙，那就再好不过了！\n……不过话说回来，是我的错觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "a806c4178bc30f2a04f11f3080f6e73b36dfb5bc1430cf793ccbbd4f863af389", "ja": "プリンセスグループでの活動は、\n妙にフィジカルを求められる局面が多いような……？", "zh": "在Princess组的活动中，\n似乎经常会遇到莫名需要体力的场面……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "fc01ef867054bd839deaa0859891d994542fd335952913cd46f574b3d89adb3d", "ja": "私も少し感じていました。\n姫君も体が資本、ということなのでしょうか……？", "zh": "我也稍微有这种感觉。看来，公主们也是要靠身体吃饭的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "03e767eb2571ae1be14c45bf8b0975f3e15a1bdc32ee670d9295bdd4619b830d", "ja": "みんな、今日は本当にありがとう！\nお礼の佐竹飯店特製炒飯、大盛りだよ！", "zh": "大家，今天真的非常感谢你们！\n作为谢礼，这是佐竹饭店特制的炒饭，超大份哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f36000ed2da9935bfde2515a1a7dc9b7bb473ba232e86c605c5743aea9793b5", "ja": "おお、食欲をそそる香り……！\nいつもおいしそうですけど、今日は格別です！", "zh": "哦，好诱人的香味……！\n平时看起来就很好吃，今天更是格外美味！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "e6e94b786b5bcaa3a3d52918acf6840e6279a9b894a5e12a35c8d3fb08182863", "ja": "はい、最後までおいしくいただけそうです♪\n……あ、今のは、はしたなかったでしょうか……。", "zh": "是的，感觉能一直美味地享用到最后呢♪\n……啊，我刚才那样说，是不是有点不雅……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "012f6f482bfc3002ad8174ffabdd2c403de3a729cdc585d3797faaa2cf85fdad", "ja": "ううん、全然！　たーんと、召し上がれ♪\n……ふふっ！", "zh": "不会，完全没有！多——吃点吧♪\n……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1042_se", "source_sha256": "fc2b0450a04029b53a4f50d1bf43b1dd4533a6262378234b43132650a081edd8", "ja": "パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1043_019min", "source_sha256": "dc19b5adb33bde6bfbec81fbe018561b70a63c94a32e6750e56f1b9e41987cd9", "ja": "えっ？　今のは、亜利沙ちゃん？", "zh": "诶？刚才那是……亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "7d5147c035390fceaff800b944f66522531f331b2d7c89cb07e6b9b7cd3b2472", "ja": "ふぉぉぉ！　いただきました、いただきましたよぉー！\n美奈子ちゃんの『お料理を振る舞う時の笑顔』！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦！收到了，收到了哦——！\n美奈子“端上料理时的笑容”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "83a00e5748ad6a3746f89a3832013350bb78bdf5f1243ee759cc3639952c94c9", "ja": "美奈子ちゃんらしい表情としては、\nこの瞬間を置いて他にありますか！？　いや、ない！", "zh": "要说最符合美奈子风格的表情，还有比这一刻更合适的吗！？不，绝对没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "20412742969a899c1e6d596dd7217dee1904d238112e9e605f163d69df05a0aa", "ja": "そうかもな。料理を提供される側から撮ったのも、\nアングルとして完璧だった。", "zh": "也许吧。从接受料理的一方拍下这个瞬间，作为拍摄角度来说也完美无缺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "b13c0b77a013f0cf8847f444c512a332acbd69d7aac6caa99550b776c3bdf1d4", "ja": "Wow！　今の一瞬を見逃さないなんて……\nさすがは亜利沙さん、お見事です♪", "zh": "Wow！　居然没有错过刚才的一瞬间……\n真不愧是亚利沙小姐，太精彩了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "23a40dbe4f49dbe58d5ccde711db776d7f4c31b7ff41f9b45166d5f475d3ec31", "ja": "結局、私はいつも通り、\n普通にお店を手伝っただけだけど……。", "zh": "结果我还是和往常一样，只是普通地帮忙看了看店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "df4e374be719e8d24b3eaf81eaa7512805ad6f21142fc97befcd8bc757b2ce7a", "ja": "いつの間にか、上手に撮ってもらえちゃったみたい。\nふふっ、ありがとう♪　私の一枚はこれでいくね！", "zh": "不知不觉间，好像就被拍得很好看呢。\n呵呵，谢谢你♪　我的这一张就选这个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "1436fd29a5a54c580810a01c25e30989820cc3a28565630c75de8e25d1f24f14", "ja": "（ドタバタしたものの、満足のいく一枚が\n撮れたようだ。亜利沙の本領発揮だな）", "zh": "（虽然一阵手忙脚乱，但好像拍到了一张令人满意的照片。\n这下算是让亜利沙大显身手了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_03_1051_p", "source_sha256": "b1604dfa179d40a8e53768a84eb9ad7e34e2a37cacb2b3e67f545085bfed9f61", "ja": "（なかなか順調だ。この調子でみんなの\n爆アゲな一枚を撮影していこう！）", "zh": "（进展相当顺利。就照这个势头，继续拍出大家超嗨的照片吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
